{
  "configuration_id": "config_011",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multiprofile RNA with scvi_n200 and avgpool is near-best, while the only image experiment, single-profile ResNet50, was weak. config_011 tests whether the image modality becomes informative under the same multiprofile/avgpool treatment, keeping ResNet50 fixed so the result mainly reflects profile/aggregation and modality rather than a new image encoder or fusion. avgpool is preferred because it is the more robust multiprofile aggregation in the RNA evidence. If this improves, multimodal ResNet50 extensions become justified; if not, it argues against further ResNet50-based multimodal investment."
}

